{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1563b58fc0a4c6b9555d6662951e86e23cecda2654d782cbb3a633270d52323",
      "text": "“帅过头了反而让人难以接近（30多岁男性）”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e34bd8694bc96b59b7eee6e9fd5993d489e43e724aeccf1a01aa172f9c0073b9",
      "text": "“感觉就算我不投他也能拿第一名……\n（20多岁女性）”，是这样的评论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:446f1badc6f260e4190986e350847bde1a88667e9a40670aab7eb5b0c0713d4e",
      "text": "天使酱和天使君的\n心思还真是复杂呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c323f39e0ec47d9c06d06fefd4e6b90e8f25943015bc0dc8d2d33778df4b1b8f",
      "text": "不过，我已经找到解决办法了。\n冬马、翔太，我马上就会反超你们的，做好心理准备吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7927ba189c4bd3c00721f385196de7935e9c5996ed2430c62be9cd33f262a194",
      "text": "哟，口气倒挺大。\n我也不会输的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f99c4b076363791150c52ed02b5569c298e15b6723ef8b7d86b50eda544db2e9",
      "text": "哎呀呀，两个人都热血上头了。\n嘛，赢的当然会是我就是了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000061:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950a703e3f69b8cb4f1207537ac6fd33126a9cd70f9c0ea2d460b62d21a6c898",
      "text": "后半场开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6430a5eff3849be5b639d68e59203119d6f7a3d8f4efbf12e76cf9d675ef62f",
      "text": "……确实，很多人都夸我很迷人。\n但是，我只想听你亲口对我说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c64d91a5da7f9744d72394f55550072d9cef23128fe2f6c8ef654f8576d8f12",
      "text": "哇，那是什么表情啊……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a07f37c243f99357e20cbc61bb160293aa01f5c809d7f3f80be172b49b9c287",
      "text": "那个略带忧伤的表情杀伤力超大呢……。\n北斗君的排名也一口气追上来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d26e2a6becda56aa7f02067a086876c888b89fa87353d72b0107a73e2ecb1a",
      "text": "可恶，后半场还没结束呢。\n胜负现在才刚刚开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
